WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.856
Would you paste your NDA, your bank statement,

2
00:00:02.856 --> 00:00:04.952
or your hospital bill into a chatbot?

3
00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:08.918
Those documents are full of names, account numbers and government IDs.

4
00:00:08.918 --> 00:00:12.488
So most people skip the review, and sign the bad clause anyway.

5
00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:14.498
CloakVault fixes that.

6
00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:19.306
It's a privacy-first document workbench built on Firebase AI Logic hybrid

7
00:00:19.306 --> 00:00:19.964
inference.

8
00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:22.664
Personal data is redacted on your device,

9
00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:25.430
and only safe tokens ever reach the cloud.

10
00:00:25.998 --> 00:00:27.120
There's no sign-up.

11
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.253
Open the workbench, and a sample freelance contract is already loaded.

12
00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:39.244
Here's the original, parsed entirely in the browser.

13
00:00:39.244 --> 00:00:43.232
And here's what the AI will see: every name, address, email,

14
00:00:43.232 --> 00:00:47.353
tax ID and bank account, swapped for a reversible local token.

15
00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:49.855
Spot something else that's sensitive?

16
00:00:49.855 --> 00:00:52.049
Highlight it, and it's redacted instantly.

17
00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:58.534
Every AI task has its own Firebase AI Logic inference mode.

18
00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:01.791
Contextual PII discovery runs only on device.

19
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:05.048
Triage and chat prefer Gemini Nano on device.

20
00:01:05.048 --> 00:01:07.147
Deep audits prefer the cloud.

21
00:01:07.147 --> 00:01:11.708
This browser has no Nano, so the SDK falls back to cloud Gemini

22
00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:16.051
automatically, and Remote Config can retune every mode live.

23
00:01:20.186 --> 00:01:21.803
Let's run a hybrid audit.

24
00:01:21.803 --> 00:01:25.879
Only the tokenized text goes to Gemini, protected by App Check.

25
00:01:25.879 --> 00:01:30.408
Seconds later, the verdict: critical risk, with clause-level findings.

26
00:01:32.304 --> 00:01:34.617
Each finding quotes the exact clause.

27
00:01:34.617 --> 00:01:38.993
Click Locate to jump straight to it, and copy a ready-to-send redline.

28
00:01:38.993 --> 00:01:40.931
The cloud only ever saw tokens,

29
00:01:40.931 --> 00:01:44.807
but the real names are re-hydrated right here, in the browser.

30
00:01:48.237 --> 00:01:49.358
Don't trust us.

31
00:01:49.358 --> 00:01:50.553
Verify the wire.

32
00:01:50.553 --> 00:01:55.486
This view shows the exact bytes that were sent, with zero raw PII,

33
00:01:55.486 --> 00:01:59.447
and SHA-256 hashes of the original and redacted text,

34
00:01:59.447 --> 00:02:01.315
computed with Web Crypto.

35
00:02:01.911 --> 00:02:05.013
Ask a follow-up, and the answer streams token by token,

36
00:02:05.013 --> 00:02:08.679
labelled with where it actually ran, and its time to first token.

37
00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:14.337
Telemetry records the real inference source, latency, and bytes kept local,

38
00:02:14.337 --> 00:02:15.833
for every single call.

39
00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:20.525
Switch on air-gap mode, and every task is locked to the device.

40
00:02:20.525 --> 00:02:22.822
With Gemini Nano installed, triage,

41
00:02:22.822 --> 00:02:25.644
chat and audits keep working fully offline.

42
00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:29.779
Without it, CloakVault refuses, and nothing leaves the machine.

43
00:02:30.363 --> 00:02:34.394
The same pipeline handles itemized medical bills and bank statements,

44
00:02:34.394 --> 00:02:38.717
and a Chrome side panel extension brings it to the terms of service on any

45
00:02:38.717 --> 00:02:39.242
web page.

46
00:02:39.793 --> 00:02:43.121
Under the hood: Firebase AI Logic hybrid inference,

47
00:02:43.121 --> 00:02:46.449
App Check with reCAPTCHA Enterprise, Remote Config,

48
00:02:46.449 --> 00:02:50.952
Firestore with zero-leak security rules, Authentication, and Hosting.

49
00:02:51.548 --> 00:02:52.294
CloakVault.

50
00:02:52.294 --> 00:02:53.855
Get the second opinion.

51
00:02:53.855 --> 00:02:55.009
Keep the secrets.

52
00:02:55.009 --> 00:02:57.113
Try it free at cloakvault.buzz.
